+ * 610AAZY8C0.bin (NWA5123-AC ZLD 6.10 AAZY.8). ZLD displays and validates
+ * fields in this blob; its exact structure is proprietary. The three
+ * checksum slots at offsets 260/264/268 are overwritten with values that
+ * match the current build.
+ */
